{"id":"ec5a304b64f912c4","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-measurable-ultrafilter.md","title":"Measurable Ultrafilter Theorem","display":"thm-measurable-ultrafilter — Measurable Ultrafilter Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-measurable-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-thm-measurable-ultrafilter"],"display":"thm-measurable-ultrafilter — Measurable Ultrafilter Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-measurable-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-measurable-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-measurable-ultrafilter — Measurable Ultrafilter Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md\">../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (measurable cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md\">../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S,\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S,\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the ultrafilter witness extracted from the measurable-cardinal definition; nonprincipality and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness are expanded instead of invoking predicates absent from the dependencies.</li>\n<li>Measurable cardinals imply the existence of elementary embeddings.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ (measurable cardinal, see [[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S,\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}ultrafilter}\\vdash{}\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\{\\alpha\\}\\notin U)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq U\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal A\\neq\\varnothing\\land|\\mathcal A|<\\kappa\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal A\\in U\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1262,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-measurable-ultrafilter.md|58-thm-measurable-ultrafilter]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["b4fb7c1808c84d14","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8"]}